{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_02_1000_101kot", "source_sha256": "665350b8a023e4cb0458791d226785e052d8a88e283b55c3040f556bf7328390", "ja": "もしもし、{$P$}さん\nお疲れさまです、音無です。", "zh": "喂，{$P$}先生。\n辛苦了，我是音无。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_02_1001_101kot", "source_sha256": "6b0d1714a39b017a6284c072ebbcac2b3f466c002252d6093231c1e8f3b85333", "ja": "突然すみません。\nあの……今夜って、お仕事のあとあいてませんか？", "zh": "突然打扰了，真不好意思。那个……今晚下班后，您有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_02_1002_101kot", "source_sha256": "a3451474e9d99ce0babd142e9d327489a542f8b0e629fba3d8d5b0e43c024419", "ja": "実は、社長とちょっとモメちゃって、\n気分転換に付き合ってもらえないかなー……なんて。", "zh": "其实我和社长稍微起了点争执，\n就想着能不能陪我换换心情呢……什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_02_1003_101kot", "source_sha256": "a4510fad7d402265c6a9ab2413e38636987bbd73990e82cee89504792b459f55", "ja": "も、もちろん、ご都合が悪ければ大丈夫です！\nそんなに深刻ってわけでもないですし……。", "zh": "当、当然，如果您不方便的话也没关系！\n也没严重到那种程度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_02_1004_101kot", "source_sha256": "11910f3d8f7e6422782379690fd6a75e9cf42a50f92c5b5b7b002f6aabc98a0e", "ja": "でも、社長ったらひどいんですよ！\nあのケーキ、一日限定5個でめったに買えないのに！", "zh": "可是社长也太过分了！那款蛋糕每天限量5个，平时根本买不到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_02_1005_101kot", "source_sha256": "b0405d019224a2b76b9cc5e1af0d9cff3d3c796462f89a7e90029d5413e232f4", "ja": "「おお、すまないねぇ。\n今度代わりに何か買ってくるよ」なんて！", "zh": "「哎呀，真是对不住啊。\n下次我买点别的东西来补偿你」什么的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_02_1006_101kot", "source_sha256": "ac0aa8687c8c5db9fcd5fdfb0f1850840ce8d81e6fab50849d0fd92d4f8c7a8f", "ja": "だから仕返しに、社長が行きたがってたスイーツ\nバイキングに行って自慢しちゃおうって思ったんです。", "zh": "所以作为回敬，我就想着去社长一直想去的甜品自助餐，然后好好炫耀一番。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_02_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "b5bd8f75ecab77ac755ef632208bab421f023bf1edfe84bc1871ba8999bbf0fb", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、ご一緒にどうですか？\nいつも頑張ってるご褒美に……とか。", "zh": "{$P$}先生要不要也一起去？\n就当作是一直以来这么努力的奖励……之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_02_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "539b2ec1c9a0f00de1f4fbe46748094ee5ad937949071af43e55fd0d5add7f94", "ja": "その後は、オシャレなバーに行って、そのまま\nいい雰囲気に……はっ！？　だめ、だめよ小鳥～！", "zh": "之后去时髦的酒吧，然后就这样顺势发展成浪漫的氛围……啊！？不行不行，小鸟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_02_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "1de776064d5fabe5d60f8ffcbffba2791273c762c2350c6cffb704bc96044f3a", "ja": "と、とにかく、ご都合がよければ……\nお返事、待ってますね。それじゃあ。", "zh": "总、总之，如果您方便的话……\n我等着您的回复哦。那么再见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
